;; proof-receipt). It describes source commit de05422 and the agda job of
;; Agda Proofs run 43981542366 on that commit: Agda 2.7.0.1 (release tarball,
;; sha256 975b515a…) and agda-stdlib v2.3 (tag archive, digest-pinned in the
;; workflow). Every :pwg is the value the reader derives (standards
;; deed_lint.js --proof-receipt-json). Rows, statements and scope are in
;; docs/status/PROOF-STATUS.adoc, "Claims".
;;
;; The proven rows are PWG-3: no Rocq or Lean leg exists. The open rows are
;; ungraded. This repository is a frozen hand-off record (D-2026-06-21).
;;
;; Import cone: agda --dependency-graph over All.agda gives 209 modules: 76
;; of this repository, 126 of agda-stdlib and 7 supplied with Agda. The home
;; manifest also lists ordinal-notation.agda-lib and the workflow that holds
;; the stdlib and Agda pins. The stdlib import lists the 126 modules and the
;; library file. Tag v2.3 resolves to 8326c74; its .gitattributes has no
;; export-ignore or export-subst, so the tag archive CI downloads carries the
;; blobs of that commit.
;;
;; A comment-aware postulate scan of the cone finds only the four
;; Agda.Primitive postulates listed in (trusted-base). The quarantined
;; Buchholz/Fidelity.agda (two postulates, not --safe) is outside the cone:
;; no module imports it.
